  "body": "Imagine seeing in 2027 from your very own deck, the BBQ fired up, your favourite people around you and a view across the Hauraki Gulf stretching all the way to the city.\r\n\r\nYES! A quick settlement is very much available. Our owners have purchased and have already settled into their new home. You could say they're pretty serious about selling…\r\n\r\nHow serious, though? Auction serious. Ready-to-sell-unconditionally serious.\r\n\r\nHere, you're buying into the Bucklands Beach lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe real Bucklands Beach, though. The by-the-beach Bucklands Beach.\r\n\r\nSet on its own driveway, this home has plenty to get excited about. A generous lawn ready for summer games, a north-facing deck and enough off-street parking that everyone can come over.\r\n\r\nInside, there's a world of opportunity. On the lower level, you'll find the entrance, a single garage with internal access, a study or utility room, and plenty of storage. Upstairs, two generous bedrooms both have direct access to the main bathroom, which our owners renovated within the last few years.\r\n\r\nWant to get creative, add your own personality and make this a place that's truly yours? Or would you prefer to walk in, do nothing and simply enjoy? Well, both options are there.\r\n\r\nYou'll be pleased to hear that our owners have maintained the home meticulously over their nearly nine years here. They've recently had the iron roof maintained and repainted. Over the years, they've also repainted inside and out, had the driveway and paths treated, and renovated the bathroom and kitchen.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? On the peninsula and in zone for Macleans College.\r\n\r\nDoes it get any better?\r\n\r\nWalk to the beach, then grab a glass of your favourite and enjoy a fine meal at one of the local restaurants.\r\n\r\nThere's a reason so many long-standing residents simply don't want to leave this glorious spot.\r\n\r\nHalf Moon Bay is a short walk away if you've got your walking shoes on! Prefer the bus? There's a stop about 350 metres from your driveway.\r\n\r\nDownsizing or moving sideways? First home or last home? Wherever you are in the cycle, we know you're going to love calling 1A Lynton Road home.\r\n\r\nReady? They are.\r\n+ Set! Home!\r\n\r\nSeriously + For Sale via Auction \r\nDate: Tuesday, 15th December 2026 (unless sold prior) \r\nWhen: 6:00 pm \r\nWhere: Bucklands Beach Yacht Club",
